Package: STRprofilerR
Title: Compare Short Tandem Repeat Profiles for Model Authentication
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jared", "Andrews", email = "jared.andrews07@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares short tandem repeat (STR) profiles to authenticate
    biomedical models such as cell lines and xenografts against the primary
    tissue samples they were derived from. Provides the Tanabe (Sorenson-Dice),
    Masters (versus query), and Masters (versus reference) similarity scores,
    heuristics for detecting sample mixing, flexible ingest of wide and long
    profile formats, comparison against user-supplied reference databases, and
    querying of the Cellosaurus knowledge base through the CLASTR REST API.
    A command line application is included for use in automated workflows.
